rs and reports what a\n-// model did with the commands a turn offered it: the `COMMAND:` lines it printed,\n-// the reads and writes in order, and whether a started loop ran its init first.\n+// Reads captured sessions through the shared session readers and prints counts\n+// and verdicts per runtime and arm: how often an offered command was started,\n+// seen or declined, which runs were unsafe and which started loops skipped their init.\n //\n // Two input shapes share one CLI. `--summary` takes one or more run logs and\n // scores every row they list. `--runtime` plus `--locator` scores the one session\n // a locator names, which is how a single smoke run is checked before a whole arm\n","status":"modified","additions":3,"deletions":3}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\",\"oldString\":\"// Reads a captured session through the shared session readers and reports what a\\n// model did with the commands a turn offered it: the `COMMAND:` lines it printed,\\n// the reads and writes in order, and whether a started loop ran its init first.\",\"newString\":\"// Reads captured sessions through the shared session readers and prints counts\\n// and verdicts per runtime and arm: how often an offered command was started,\\n// seen or declined, which runs were unsafe and which started loops skipped their init.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794589626644,"end":1794589627894}}}}
